(   [Problem Statement]: Demonstrate how to write concise and readable list, dictionary, and set comprehensions with conditional filtering.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Comprehensions provide expressive syntax to construct collections:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   # 1. List Comprehension with filtering) Tj
T*
(   evens_sq = [x**2 for x in range\(20\) if x % 2 == 0]) Tj
T*
() Tj
