T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Formatted String Literals \(F-Strings, Python 3.6+\):) Tj
T*
(   `f'Voltage: {v:0.2f} V, Code: {code:04X}'`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   F-strings are evaluated at runtime directly as bytecode expressions, offering superior) Tj
T*
(   execution speed and inline expression evaluation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
