(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Disjoint Set Union \(Union-Find\) data structure with path compression and union by rank in Python.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Union-Find manages disjoint sets with near constant-time operations:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   class UnionFind:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, n: int\):) Tj
T*
(   self.parent = list\(range\(n\)\)) Tj
T*
(   self.rank = [0] * n) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def find\(self, i: int\) -> int:) Tj
T*
(   if self.parent[i] != i:) Tj
T*
(   # Path compression) Tj
T*
(   self.parent[i] = self.find\(self.parent[i]\)) Tj
T*
(   return self.parent[i]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def union\(self, i: int, j: int\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   root_i = self.find\(i\)) Tj
T*
