(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Huffman Encoding algorithm using Python dictionaries and `heapq` for binary data compression.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Huffman coding generates optimal prefix-free codes for data compression:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   import heapq) Tj
T*
(   from collections import Counter) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class HuffmanNode:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, char, freq\):) Tj
T*
(   self.char = char) Tj
T*
(   self.freq = freq) Tj
T*
(   self.left = None) Tj
T*
(   self.right = None) Tj
T*
(   def __lt__\(self, other\):) Tj
T*
(   return self.freq < other.freq) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def build_huffman_codes\(text\):) Tj
T*
(   counts = Counter\(text\)) Tj
T*
(   heap = [HuffmanNode\(ch, fr\) for ch, fr in counts.items\(\)]) Tj
T*
(   heapq.heapify\(heap\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   while len\(heap\) > 1:) Tj
T*
